/****************************
We are verifying Trans in HOL-CSP as a parameterized recursive process, 
so this eol is updated from the original EOL by modifying Rule 53 and Rule 54
to enrich the semantics.
Rule 53: 
(1) changed to ParamAction, 
(2) recursive Trans pushed into extchoice
Rule 54: 
(1) Skip replaced by Trans(tgt)
(2) "n = src" added as guard in Rule 54 for each transition
This parameterization is only for Trans, other actions are not affected.
IsaCircus will need this parameterization as well later on, so we use only one version M2M to generate Circusfor both HOL-CSP and IsaCircus.

TBD: (3) add a branch for final state: (n=fi)& (terminate -> Skip)

